    {
      "subId": "101508",
      "subQuestName": "Inspect the Guizhong Ballista",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101503",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10150301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10150301": {
            "id": "10150301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It's huge! Paimon can totally believe it took an adeptus to build this.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10150302"
            ]
          },
          "10150302": {
            "id": "10150302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But... how do you operate this thing? Just think how much strength you would need...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10150303"
            ]
          },
          "10150303": {
            "id": "10150303",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Hmm... It is currently inoperable, in any case. This device is broken.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10150304"
            ]
          },
          "10150304": {
            "id": "10150304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Aw, what? It broke!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10150305"
            ]
          },
          "10150305": {
            "id": "10150305",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "After millennia of wear and tear, even adepti contraptions are difficult to maintain.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10150306"
            ]
          },
          "10150306": {
            "id": "10150306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So what're we gonna do? Quick, Mr. Zhongli, use your unlimited high-society knowledge powers!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10150307"
            ]
          },
          "10150307": {
            "id": "10150307",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Hmm. You almost make it sound like I'm some sort of... bourgeois parasite, whose only utility lies in providing quaint pieces of trivia on demand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10150308"
            ]
          },
          "10150308": {
            "id": "10150308",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "That said, let me think for a moment... Ah yes. Spare parts were made for the Guizhong Ballista when it was first built, in case it was damaged in battle.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10150309"
            ]
          },
          "10150309": {
            "id": "10150309",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "As I recall, there is a military supply post from that period somewhere inside the Pass.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10150310"
            ]
          },
          "10150310": {
            "id": "10150310",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "If we can retrieve the spare parts from where they are stored, we may be able to repair the Guizhong Ballista. One just needs to understand the basic working principles of the device.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10150311"
            ]
          },
          "10150311": {
            "id": "10150311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So... what you're saying is that you actually understand the working principles?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10150312"
            ]
          },
          "10150312": {
            "id": "10150312",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "I have a smattering of knowledge on the topic.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10150313"
            ]
          },
          "10150313": {
            "id": "10150313",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "With the <color=#00E1FFFF>parts</color> in hand, I could at least tinker with it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101504",
